    "detailed_description": "FLARE is an immersive first-person sci-fi action adventure. Enter the maze. Survive and find your path to discover the secrets past the gates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124000/extras/5eca9d65c3212e62862a11ff0da2de49.avif?t=1725382287\" width=450 height=80 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Story:</strong> Enter a new world of mysterious technologies and uncover the secrets hiding in the shadows.<br></li><li><strong>Engaging Movement:</strong> Experience complete freedom with a movement system designed to give you complete control of your character. Run, jump, crouch, climb and crawl to find your way through the many obstacles of the maze.<br></li><li><strong>Fast-Paced action:</strong> Be prepared to face powerful enemies that will test your abilities as your power grows.<br></li><li><strong>Interactive Weapons:</strong> Unlock weapons and abilities designed to feel physical and responsive in your hands.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124000/extras/224cdc865668de52dd860234f3a4af2c.poster.avif?t=1725382287\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124000/extras/224cdc865668de52dd860234f3a4af2c.webm?t=1725382287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124000/extras/224cdc865668de52dd860234f3a4af2c.mp4?t=1725382287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
